# VMware guest integration (shared clipboard, resizing, better mouse
# sync). spice-vdagent covers QEMU/virt-manager/GNOME Boxes too, in case
# you test outside VMware. Flatpak gives access to a huge catalog of
# native Linux apps out of the box, on top of apt's own package archive.

open-vm-tools
open-vm-tools-desktop
spice-vdagent
qemu-guest-agent
flatpak
